comments.body:
@zackify thanks for submitting this issue. Indeed the configure is only adding new elements.

@mthuret What about we cache the previous configure props and create a delta that we would then apply? This mean that when a property is removed we will know it instead of being left in the state it was previously set.

In the meantime, @zackify, can you to force the value of `insideBoundingBox` to `''` at step 2?

Yes right now, the configure props in the search state are cleaned only if the <Configure/> widget is unmounted. 

@bobylito Another possibility would be to pass the previous props to the transitionState method. 
Regarding the caching way, how will you handle the fact that we can have a multiple <Configure/> instance?
